# Accepted vulnerabilities for the image scan (Trivy). Every entry needs a
# reason and an expiry date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD): after that date Trivy stops
# ignoring it and the CI gate fails again. On expiry, do not just move the
# date: update the image if a fix has shipped, or write down a new reason.
#
# Format:
#   # Why it is accepted, and what removes it (e.g. the image bump that fixes it)
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# No accepted vulnerabilities at the moment.
